cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DynaFX in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "DynaFX"
abstract: >-
  A semantic simulation platform for building cognitive digital twins. It
  unifies multi-paradigm simulation (System Dynamics, Agent-Based Modeling,
  Discrete Event Simulation) with symbolic knowledge representation
  (RDF/OWL/SPARQL), enabling digital twins that reason over knowledge and
  continuously adapt through feedback. The KB and simulation form one living
  system: knowledge graph to parameters, multi-paradigm simulation, evidence
  triples back into the graph, then rules and optimization.
keywords:
  - system dynamics
  - agent-based modeling
  - discrete-event simulation
  - digital twin
  - knowledge graph
  - RDF
  - OWL
  - SPARQL
  - semantic simulation
license: MIT
type: software
